WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.469
So that's why I made Sound Shaper:

2
00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:06.100
a personal MP3 player that works without internet.

3
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.041
You upload your song once and you can make it slow or

4
00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:11.927
fast, add any effects you want; it has an equalizer,

5
00:00:11.927 --> 00:00:14.480
and you can make clips of your favorite parts.

6
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.479
On YouTube Music or YouTube,

7
00:00:16.479 --> 00:00:19.192
a song sounds the way it was uploaded,

8
00:00:19.192 --> 00:00:21.905
but here you upload it, you change it,

9
00:00:21.905 --> 00:00:24.118
and you choose how you hear it.
